{
  "id": "poem-4d606f3ca6f1849d083baa82",
  "title": "点绛唇",
  "author": "高明《蔡伯喈琵琶记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "月淡星稀，建章宫里，千门晓。",
    "御炉烟袅，隐隐鸣梢杳。",
    "忽忆年时，问寝高堂早。",
    "鸡鸣了，闷萦怀抱，此际愁多少！。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-5020",
